@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2D3748
    ActorBorderColor #2D3748
    LifeLineBorderColor #2D3748
    ParticipantBorderColor #2D3748
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BoxBorderColor #A0AEC0
}

actor "Workspace Admin" as Admin
boundary "Master Dashboard UI" as UI
control "Spring Security" as Security
control "MasterAnalyticsController" as Controller
control "MasterAnalyticsService" as Service
collections "Redis Cache" as Cache
entity "TenantInfoRepository" as TenantRepo
entity "TenantSubscriptionRepository" as SubRepo
entity "InvoiceRepository" as InvoiceRepo
database "Master PostgreSQL" as MasterDB

== 1. Yêu cầu tải Chỉ số Doanh thu Nền tảng ==

Admin -> UI : 1: Truy cập tab "Tổng quan & Doanh thu"
activate UI

UI -> Security : 2: GET /api/v1/master/analytics/revenue\n[Authorization: Bearer <JWT>]
activate Security

alt 1. Token không hợp lệ hoặc thiếu quyền
    Security --> UI : 3a: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden
    UI --> Admin : 4a: Hiển thị lỗi truy cập hoặc chuyển về login
else 2. Xác thực thành công (Role: WORKSPACE_ADMIN)
    Security -> Controller : 3b: Chuyển tiếp request
    activate Controller
    deactivate Security

    Controller -> Service : 4b: calculateRevenueAnalytics()
    activate Service

    == 2. Kiểm tra Cache Phân tích ==

    Service -> Cache : 5: GET master:analytics:revenue
    activate Cache

    alt 2.1 Cache Hit (Dữ liệu đã được tính toán)
        Cache --> Service : 6a: Trả về RevenueAnalyticsResponse từ cache
    else 2.2 Cache Miss (Tổng hợp dữ liệu từ Master DB)
        Cache --> Service : 6b: null (Không có cache)
        deactivate Cache

        note over Service, MasterDB
            Giao dịch chỉ đọc: @Transactional(transactionManager = "masterTransactionManager", readOnly = true)
        end note

        Service -> TenantRepo : 7: countByStatus("ACTIVE")
        activate TenantRepo
        TenantRepo -> MasterDB : 8: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM tenants WHERE status = 'ACTIVE'
        activate MasterDB
        MasterDB --> TenantRepo : 9: 42 active tenants
        deactivate MasterDB
        TenantRepo --> Service : 10: 42
        deactivate TenantRepo

        Service -> SubRepo : 11: findActiveSubscriptions()
        activate SubRepo
        SubRepo -> MasterDB : 12: SELECT ts, p FROM tenant_subscriptions ts JOIN subscription_plans p ON ts.plan_id = p.id WHERE ts.status = 'ACTIVE'
        activate MasterDB
        MasterDB --> SubRepo : 13: List<TenantSubscription> (kèm giá gói)
        deactivate MasterDB
        SubRepo --> Service : 14: List<TenantSubscription>
        deactivate SubRepo

        Service -> InvoiceRepo : 15: sumPaidAmountBetween(startDate, endDate)
        activate InvoiceRepo
        InvoiceRepo -> MasterDB : 16: SELECT SUM(amount) FROM invoices WHERE status = 'PAID' AND paid_at BETWEEN ...
        activate MasterDB
        MasterDB --> InvoiceRepo : 17: Tổng doanh thu đã thanh toán
        deactivate MasterDB
        InvoiceRepo --> Service : 18: BigDecimal totalPaid
        deactivate InvoiceRepo

        Service -> Service : 19: Tính toán MRR, ARR, growthRate (+18.5%),\nphân bổ gói (STARTER: 15, PRO: 22, ENTERPRISE: 5)
        
        Service -> Cache : 20: SET master:analytics:revenue (TTL = 10m)
        activate Cache
        Cache --> Service : 21: OK
        deactivate Cache
    end

    Service --> Controller : 22: RevenueAnalyticsResponse
    deactivate Service

    Controller --> UI : 23: 200 OK + ApiResponse<RevenueAnalyticsResponse>
    deactivate Controller

    UI --> Admin : 24: Render 4 Thẻ KPI (MRR, ARR, Tenants, SLA)\nvà Biểu đồ Phân bổ Gói Cước
    deactivate UI
end

== 3. Xuất Báo cáo Tài chính (CSV Export) ==

opt Workspace Admin nhấn "Xuất báo cáo tài chính (CSV)"
    Admin -> UI : 25: Nhấn "Xuất báo cáo tài chính (CSV)"
    activate UI
    UI -> UI : 26: Kết xuất dữ liệu Tenant & Doanh thu thành file CSV\n(Mã, Tên, Subdomain, Database, Trạng thái)
    UI --> Admin : 27: Tự động tải xuống file smarthire_tenants_report_YYYY-MM-DD.csv\nkèm thông báo hoàn tất
    deactivate UI
end

@enduml
